!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class2/schema/invalid/a-sized-array-over-a-parameter-inside-an-open-record-expected.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/schema-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.10, [TSON-SCHEMA] §5.3"
  description: """
    Inside an open record a form over a parameter is admitted only where it is a reference. `[T]` is the reference
    `meta.array<T>`; a size sets `min_items`, a field no argument list carries, so `[T; 1..]` is no reference and the
    declaration is refused, naming the form. A refined constructor applied, `nonempty_type<T>`, says it instead.
    """
  error: {
    category: resolver
  }
}
